# 内建函数收到类型不对的参数时,要给 Ravel 消息,不能漏出 C# 的硬转型异常
# (下面那条旧消息就是修之前的样子)
# Unable to cast object of type .Ravel.Runtime.IntVal. to type .Ravel.Runtime.StringVal.
f := () => { 1; }
f.name = 123
# --- expected ---
# Error: 函数名需要 string，得到 Integer
#   --> tests/157_builtin_arg_type.rav:5:1
#   5 | f.name = 123
#     | ^
#   调用栈 (1 层):
#     在 tests/157_builtin_arg_type.rav:1:1
